Package: krubus-default-settings
Version: 1.0.6
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KRubus Project <https://github.com/GamingTux/KRubus>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/KRubus
Depends: systemd, systemd-zram-generator, earlyoom, pipewire, rpi-power-profiles, krubus-kernel-hook
Description: Default system tuning and performance profiles for KRubus (Pi 5)
 Central system tuning and performance configuration for KRubus on Raspberry Pi 5,
 Pi 500 and Compute Module 5 (BCM2712 / Cortex-A76):
  - Dynamic ZRAM zstd compression scaled up to 8 GB (prevents OOM lockups)
  - Ultra-low-latency 0.5 ms schedutil governor & MGLRU working-set tuning
  - TCP BBR congestion control, fastopen, and optimized socket buffer ceilings
  - EarlyOOM crash protection for KDE Plasma Wayland sessions
  - PipeWire multi-rate native audio engine (44.1 kHz - 96 kHz)
  - Mesa single-file shader cache and flash-safe journald persistence
